and start wishing lots of goodies (You have a WoW)
Go to level 2, die there,

If you're lucky this becomes a bones level.

If so repeat those steps again and again
[ Start in discovery mode,
  Go to level 2
  If it's not the bone level Quit
  Else use the goodies, and create more
  (Dragon Scale Mail, Mjollnir, Helm of telepathy, 20 tins of spinach and an opener
   +5 pair of speed boots etc etc )
  BTW I'm able to wish for a +100 Dragon Scale Mail and a +25 long sword,
  but I hear that most NetHacks don't do this,
  probably thanks to the same hacking guy
  Save your game,
  Restart
  Die -> If you don't dsee a bones level  goto Restart
  goto Start
]

